multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda_out
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/MultiLabelMarginCriterion.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda_out(
        grad_output: Tensor,
        self: Tensor,
        target: Tensor,
        reduction: int64,
        is_target: Tensor,
        grad_input: Tensor (out)
    ) -> Tensor

【算法】
    multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda_out_template(grad_output, self, target, reduction, is_target, grad_input)
    return grad_input

--------------------------------
multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/MultiLabelMarginCriterion.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda(
        grad_output: Tensor,
        self: Tensor,
        target: Tensor,
        reduction: int64,
        is_target: Tensor
    ) -> Tensor

【算法】
    grad_input = at::zeros_like(self, LEGACY_CONTIGUOUS_MEMORY_FORMAT)
    multilabel_margin_loss_backward_cuda_out_template(grad_output, self, target, reduction, is_target, grad_input)
    return grad_input
